	<string>FLINX uses the camera to scan device QR codes during setup.</string>
	<key>NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription</key>
	<string>FLINX uses your location to find and connect nearby door-control devices.</string>
	<key>NSMicrophoneUsageDescription</key>
	<string>FLINX uses the microphone when you choose features that record audio.</string>
	<key>NSPhotoLibraryAddUsageDescription</key>
	<string>FLINX saves report images to your photo library when you choose Save.</string>
